            "review_title": "Review at YUKINO Foods",
            "review_text": "MeiMei\n1 contribution\n2\nAmazing\nFeb 2020\nI had a very special experience here. I'm a heathy & picky person and this market is exactly what i have been looking for for a long time. The menu is diverse and yummy and fresh. I really love it and will come back when i'' be back to Vietnam.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 18, 2020\nYUKINO FOODS\nHi MeiMei - thank you for sharing our vision and mission on healthy food! Very gratifying to hear. We will continue to do our best and keep things fresh!\nRead more\nWritten February 19, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
